{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Super-B, a colorful social playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends, decorate your own space, and dive into exciting mini-games\u2014just like hanging out at a theme park full of fun surprises!<br><br><strong>(*) All game data obtained during the demo play (characters, items, currency, levels, experience, etc.) will be reset once the Steam NEXT Fest ends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the following content:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. My Home Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room with furniture and create your own personal space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends over, share quick co-op activities, or just have fun messing around with emotes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1760411049\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02.\u00a0Match-Based Mini-Games\u00a0</strong><br>Take on a wide variety of fast-paced game modes in real time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Defusal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacle Races</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide &amp; Seek<br> \u2026and many more to come through future updates!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.poster.avif?t=1760411049\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.webm?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.mp4?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.poster.avif?t=1760411049\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.webm?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.mp4?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.poster.avif?t=1760411049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.webm?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.mp4?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>03. Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity with over 1,000 parts and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Mix and match outfits, hairstyles, hats, pets, and emotes to create a character that\u2019s truly one of a kind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/c3af076748af1d4e603176a06a5ed898.avif?t=1760411049\" data-has-big width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.poster.avif?t=1760411049\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.webm?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.mp4?t=1760411049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>04. Endless Fun</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own space, hang out with friends, or climb the rankings in competitive matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether cooperating or competing, every play session brings fresh new experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991840/extras/d60253b3d910c0bd42a36ce1a397b7bb.avif?t=1760411049\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul>